                ['id' => 'perimetre', 'title' => 'Seller and scope', 'paragraphs' => ['These terms concern distance purchases of goods from HOMYA by consumers delivered in France, Belgium or Germany. The seller is HOMYA, identified below.', 'Local orders may be recorded pending payment. Outstanding details must be completed before commercial publication. Business sales require appropriate terms.'], 'company_details' => true],
                ['id' => 'produits', 'title' => 'Products and information before purchase', 'paragraphs' => ['Product pages show the reference, available options, features, photos and tax-inclusive price. Check dimensions, compatibility and installation requirements before ordering.', 'Availability is checked before confirmation. Internal stock quantities are not published. Any advertised reduction must be supported by actual HOMYA price history.', 'Heating equipment may require a qualified installer. Purchasing a product does not automatically include installation, commissioning or collection of an old appliance.']],
                ['id' => 'commande', 'title' => 'Prices, orders and payment', 'paragraphs' => ['Prices are in euros including tax. The amount payable is the confirmed order summary total; stated delivery charges are €0 for served countries. A single VAT rate is not inferred from the company VAT number.', 'Choose a product and options, add it to the basket, then check quantities and total. You can correct your choices before providing contact and delivery details. Terms acceptance is required before confirmation.', 'Only payment methods displayed as available can be used. A provider must still be selected and configured for cards; Visa, Mastercard and CB depend on provider setup and acceptance. Transfers require HOMYA business bank details. Logos are not proof of active payment.', 'Without a configured card payment service and bank details, the order is recorded pending payment instructions, without a debit or funds collection. Its reference, total, status and available documents appear on the private confirmation page. Email is described as sent only after an actual sending.', 'The transfer and reservation period is 72 hours, according to the deadline shown in the order. Payment must be reconciled before confirmation. An uploaded transfer proof does not confirm received funds. Without confirmed payment at the deadline, the pending order expires and its reservation is released. Recording an order does not cause dispatch.']],
                ['id' => 'livraison', 'title' => 'Delivery', 'paragraphs' => ['HOMYA states free delivery in France, Belgium and Germany in 3 to 7 days from payment, once confirmed. The registered office does not establish the dispatch location.', 'The stated overall delivery period includes preparation and transport. Contact HOMYA with access details to arrange receipt of a bulky item.', 'Access, unloading and handover arrangements for pallets, furniture and bulky appliances will be specified before purchase. Installation, commissioning and collection of an old appliance are not assumed to be included. HOMYA offers free returns within 14 days. See Returns & withdrawal for the arrangements.']],
                ['id' => 'france', 'title' => 'France · guarantees and complaints', 'paragraphs' => ['For new goods, the legal guarantee of conformity protects the consumer for two years from delivery; defects appearing in that period are presumed to have existed at delivery, subject to statutory exceptions. It is exercised against the seller, with conformity remedies provided free of charge.', 'The hidden-defects guarantee is separate. Extensions following repair or replacement and the prescribed guarantee information box must be incorporated into the final terms. Mediation is described below.']],
                ['id' => 'belgique', 'title' => 'Belgium · guarantees and complaints', 'paragraphs' => ['New goods sold to a consumer have a two-year legal guarantee from delivery. The presumption that the defect existed at delivery covers those two years, subject to statutory exceptions. The seller handles free repair or replacement; other remedies depend on the statutory conditions.', 'The complaints service and competent alternative dispute resolution arrangements must be specified according to the seller’s establishment and the dispute.']],
                ['id' => 'allemagne', 'title' => 'Germany · guarantees and complaints', 'paragraphs' => ['For ordinary movable goods, statutory defect claims generally have a two-year limitation period from delivery. The presumption of a defect at delivery generally applies for one year; digital elements may be subject to specific rules.', 'These rights against the seller are separate from an optional manufacturer’s guarantee. Extensions after repair and special cases, including goods used in a building, require assessment. Information about participation in dispute resolution remains to be determined under the VSBG.']],
                ['id' => 'reclamations', 'title' => 'Complaints and amicable resolution', 'paragraphs' => ['For questions, complaints or after-sales assistance, write to HOMYA at the correspondence address in the legal notice with your order reference and request. Email and telephone details appear on the Contact page and in the legal notice.', 'An amicable solution will be sought. Mediation is explained in the following section and is separate from initial complaint handling.']],
                ['id' => 'mediation', 'title' => 'Consumer mediation', 'paragraphs' => ['After a prior written complaint to HOMYA remains unresolved, consumers may request free mediation from HOMYA’s competent consumer mediator. Costs of an adviser or expert chosen by the consumer remain subject to applicable rules.', 'Apply no later than one year after the written complaint to HOMYA, subject to other statutory admissibility conditions. Include the complaint, any reply and supporting documents. The mediator assesses admissibility and explains the procedure.', 'Mediation is voluntary. It is not a compulsory prerequisite to court proceedings and does not remove mandatory protections or applicable consumer jurisdiction rules.'], 'mediator_details' => true],
