                ['id' => 'modalites', 'title' => 'Return terms at a glance', 'paragraphs' => ['These rules concern consumer distance purchases, subject to applicable statutory exceptions for certain goods. The return address is confirmed; free transport must be arranged with HOMYA.'], 'items' => ['Withdrawal: notify your decision within 14 calendar days after receipt; send goods back within 14 days after notification.', 'Refund: no later than 14 days after notification, subject to the lawful deferral explained below. Bank credit timing depends on the provider.', 'Free outbound delivery in France, Belgium and Germany; HOMYA pays return costs for requests notified within 14 days after receipt.', 'Notification and returns: HOMYA at the return address published below. An unambiguous statement is sufficient to notify withdrawal.', 'Faults fall under statutory guarantees, distinct from a change of mind. No blanket exclusion for discounted, opened or bulky goods.']],
                ['id' => 'delai', 'title' => '14 days to notify withdrawal', 'paragraphs' => ['For goods covered by the statutory right of withdrawal, you have 14 calendar days from receipt by you or a designated third party other than the carrier. For several goods delivered separately or goods delivered in multiple lots, the period begins on receipt of the last goods or lot. The receipt day is not counted. In France, if the final day is a Saturday, Sunday, public holiday or non-working day, it is extended to the next working day.', 'No reason is required. Send an unambiguous statement to HOMYA at the registered office shown in the legal notice. Email details appear on the Contact page. A promotion does not remove this right.']],
                ['id' => 'retour', 'title' => 'Return and refund', 'paragraphs' => ['Return goods without undue delay and within 14 days of notifying withdrawal, unless HOMYA offers to collect them. The address below also receives pallets, furniture and bulky appliances.', 'The refund covers amounts paid for the goods and any standard delivery costs. A supplement for a more expensive delivery method chosen by the customer is not reimbursed under this rule.', 'The refund is made no later than 14 days from notification of your decision. Where the law permits, HOMYA may wait until the goods are recovered or proof of dispatch is supplied, whichever occurs first. This withholding does not apply if HOMYA offers to collect the goods.', 'The same payment method is used unless you expressly agree to another method without extra charges. The payment provider’s crediting time must be specified separately; it does not replace the applicable statutory period.', 'HOMYA pays return costs when withdrawal is notified within 14 days after receipt. Free returns are HOMYA’s commercial commitment. Arrange transport with HOMYA: a prepaid label for a suitable parcel or collection for bulky goods, according to the arranged solution. If you advance direct return shipping costs, keep evidence for reimbursement; prior authorisation is not a condition of your withdrawal right.'], 'return_details' => true],
                ['id' => 'emballage', 'title' => 'Prepare the parcel or collection', 'paragraphs' => ['Protect the goods for transport and include accessories and the order reference, if available. Original packaging is recommended when available, but missing packaging or opening a parcel does not automatically remove the withdrawal right.', 'Any diminished value must result from handling beyond what is necessary to establish the nature, characteristics and functioning of the goods, subject to statutory information requirements. No flat restocking fee or return penalty applies.']],
                ['id' => 'exceptions', 'title' => 'Exceptions and faulty goods', 'paragraphs' => ['Statutory exceptions must be assessed for each product and disclosed before purchase where applicable, for example goods genuinely made to a customer’s specifications. No general exclusion for opened, discounted or bulky products is applied here.', 'For defects or non-conformity, provide your order reference and describe the issue. This concerns statutory guarantees and is not limited to the 14-day withdrawal period. Remedies under the legal guarantee of conformity are free for the consumer, including necessary transport costs; this process is separate from a change-of-mind return.']],
                ['id' => 'france', 'title' => 'France · online withdrawal', 'paragraphs' => ['Consumer Code article L221-21, in force since 19 June 2026, requires a free withdrawal function for distance contracts concluded through an online interface. It must be available during the withdrawal period and provide an acknowledgement.']],
                ['id' => 'belgique', 'title' => 'Belgium · online withdrawal', 'paragraphs' => ['FPS Economy states that an online withdrawal function has been mandatory since 14 August 2026. It must be easy to find and use, available during the period and followed by confirmation.']],
                ['id' => 'allemagne', 'title' => 'Germany · Widerruf', 'paragraphs' => ['BGB section 356a requires an accessible withdrawal function during the period, an explicit confirmation step and an acknowledgement that can be retained, including the statement, date and time. The German withdrawal notice and model form must be tailored to the seller.']],
                ['id' => 'procedure', 'title' => 'How to request a return', 'paragraphs' => ['First notify your decision, then arrange free transport. The return receiving address appears above. Electronic contact details appear on the Contact page; post can also notify your decision.'], 'items' => ['To notify withdrawal by post, send an unambiguous statement to HOMYA at the registered office in the legal notice. You may use the example below; it is not compulsory.', 'Specify the goods and access constraints relevant to transport. HOMYA must arrange and pay for suitable parcel shipping or collection of bulky goods. Times and collection appointments remain to be arranged; waiting for logistics instructions must not deprive you of your rights.', 'Send goods back within the applicable period and keep dispatch evidence. Withdrawal does not depend on prior seller permission.', 'Refunds follow the rules above. Identify your order for reconciliation; do not send passwords or complete card details.']],
                ['id' => 'declaration', 'title' => 'Example postal withdrawal statement', 'paragraphs' => ['To HOMYA at the registered office in the legal notice. I hereby withdraw from the contract for these goods: [product / reference]. Ordered on [date], received on [date]. Order reference: [reference]. Consumer name and address: [name / address]. Date: [date]. Consumer signature for a paper statement.', 'The address above receives both your notification and returned goods. Arrange transport of bulky items with HOMYA; notifying withdrawal does not require prior seller approval.']],
                ['id' => 'preparation', 'title' => 'HOMYA procedures to complete', 'items' => ['Carrier, prepaid labels, free collection procedures and appointments to arrange, especially for bulky goods.', 'Online withdrawal with acknowledgement.', 'Effective refund processing to check before commercial publication.'], 'paragraphs' => ['The online withdrawal feature and acknowledgement remain to be implemented. Post to the registered office can notify a decision; this page does not transmit a request.']],
