                ['id' => 'finalites', 'title' => 'Data use and retention', 'paragraphs' => ['Order preparation, management, tracking, returns and payment reconciliation serve the contract or requested pre-contractual measures. Applicable accounting and tax duties rest on legal obligations; service security rests on legitimate interests, subject to assessment of individuals’ rights.', 'Order data is retained for handling, then in accordance with applicable duties and limitation periods. A documented retention schedule, recipients and deletion arrangements remain to be completed. Expiring a reservation after 72 hours does not automatically delete the customer file.', 'This policy does not activate marketing registration, campaigns or customer accounts. Future consent-based marketing requires a separate optional choice that can be withdrawn; accepting terms is not advertising consent.']],
                ['id' => 'destinataires', 'title' => 'Recipients and external services', 'paragraphs' => ['Data is intended for authorised HOMYA personnel to handle orders, deliveries, returns and assistance enquiries.', 'Address search uses IGN as described in the dedicated section. WhatsApp links open your messaging application; you write and send your own message.', 'Any transfers outside the European Economic Area and their safeguards must be documented for the selected providers; no future transfer is deemed approved by this policy.']],
                ['id' => 'droits', 'title' => 'Your rights', 'paragraphs' => ['Depending on processing and legal basis, GDPR provides rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection and portability. Consent may be withdrawn without affecting earlier lawful processing. Some rights have limits, including statutory retention duties.', 'To exercise your rights, send your request to HOMYA using the email details on the Contact page or by post to its registered office. You may complain to the CNIL or a competent authority in your place of residence.'], 'return_details' => true],
